# LOCKED INVOICE MODULE — DO NOT MODIFY WITHOUT EXPLICIT USER APPROVAL

The Invoice module is an approved, frozen baseline (premium cinematic Invoice Management UI plus the royal printable invoice paper). Do not change, redesign, restyle, restyle-via-globals, add, remove, resize, or reposition anything in it unless the user explicitly requests that specific Invoice change in the current conversation.

This lock is independent of the Login Page, Dashboard, Clients Management, Calendar, Bookings, and Gallery locks. All remain fully in force.

## Before editing any file below

Require an explicit user instruction that clearly asks to modify Invoice (for example: “change the Invoice paper header” or “update the Invoice preview toolbar”). Unrelated work, other modules, refactors, “while we’re here” polish, and inferred improvements are not approval.

