## Preserve exactly

- Invoice Management layout and visual hierarchy (hero, KPIs, search/filters, table/cards, generate/edit/view flow)
- Crystal/glass ERP chrome for the Invoice *module screens* (not the printable paper)
- Invoice Preview modal layout and scroll behavior as last approved: viewport-fit modal, sticky action toolbar (Add Payment, Edit, Print, PDF, Share, WhatsApp, Close), body `scrollTop` reset on open, `overflow-anchor: none`, invoice document first then Payment History below — do not reintroduce the auto-scroll/jump bug
- Premium royal invoice *paper* design as last approved: ivory A4, maroon/gold frame filling the page, flex column so terms/stamp/tagline sit at the bottom, typography, table, totals
- One A4 PDF page matching preview (`#invoice-document-print` capture); do not reintroduce a short capture with empty space below the frame, or a text-only `wa.me` WhatsApp send
- WhatsApp sends the invoice **PDF file** (Web Share `files` only; fallback saves the PDF for the user to send). Do not switch WhatsApp back to caption-only chat URLs
- Existing Invoice functionality: list/get APIs, totals/calculations, deliverables, Print, PDF generation, Share, payment history UI wiring, permissions, and routes
- Invoice-related tests and their assertions

## Recorded explicit approval (2026-08-23)

User-approved Invoice changes, now frozen: WhatsApp sends the generated invoice PDF; PDF/print paper fills one A4 page like the preview (frame to the bottom, footer at the bottom). Layout of Invoice Management screens, other toolbar actions, and other modules stay locked.

## Other work must stay independent

Work on Login, Dashboard, Clients, Bookings, Calendar, Gallery, and other modules without touching the files above.

If you must change shared CSS, layout shells, or shared files that Invoice *calls* (`payments-service`, `AddPaymentModal`, `booking-form` formatters, `api-error`, `cn`):

- Do not alter `.dhara-inv`, `.dhara-inv-*`, `.dhara-inv-paper`, `invoices-page.css`, or `invoice-paper-styles.ts`.
- Scope new styles so they cannot override Invoice descendants or the printable paper.
- Prefer new class names over changing globals used by Invoice.
- Other modules may *call* those shared files, but must preserve Invoice’s current appearance and functionality exactly (including preview open-at-top behavior and `#invoice-document-print` capture for Print/PDF). Do not edit the locked Invoice files listed above without explicit Invoice approval.

## Allowed exception

Only modify the Invoice module when the user clearly asks for a specific Invoice change in that conversation.

Do not weaken `.cursor/rules/locked-login-page.mdc`, `.cursor/rules/locked-dashboard.mdc`, `.cursor/rules/locked-clients-module.mdc`, `.cursor/rules/locked-calendar-module.mdc`, or `.cursor/rules/locked-gallery-module.mdc`.
